WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.250
<b>Track and Field</b>

00:09.750 --> 00:11.580
<b>That's everyone.</b>

00:12.880 --> 00:15.960
<b>All of you here support the Hero Club.</b>

00:21.460 --> 00:24.920
<b>Um, do we really need these disguises?</b>

00:26.500 --> 00:27.630
<b>It's to get us in the mood!</b>

00:31.420 --> 00:36.670
<b>We need your help to resume activities
without the Student Council knowing.</b>

00:37.960 --> 00:40.170
<b>All the sports teams want to help!</b>

00:40.170 --> 00:41.130
<b>Yup!</b>

00:42.080 --> 00:45.540
<b>All the cultural clubs have got your back, too!</b>

00:47.670 --> 00:49.040
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:49.710 --> 00:50.960
<b>Now, Noda-kun and the rest of you-</b>

00:50.960 --> 00:52.540
<b>Say no more!</b>

00:53.750 --> 00:55.880
<b>Yamato, she's over here.</b>

00:55.880 --> 00:57.000
<b>This way, huh?</b>

00:57.000 --> 01:00.500
<b>I realize now that this town needs the Hero Club!</b>

01:00.880 --> 01:02.000
<b>The time has come.</b>

01:02.540 --> 01:04.670
<b>You were just feeling lonely, right?</b>

01:04.670 --> 01:07.170
<b>Are you talking about yourself, Rei?</b>

01:07.790 --> 01:08.960
<b>Shut it, Futaba!</b>

01:12.130 --> 01:15.790
<b>Hero Ticket</b>

01:12.130 --> 01:15.790
<b>Valid anytime, anywhere!</b>

01:12.210 --> 01:14.000
<b>Are these tickets still valid?</b>

01:14.330 --> 01:15.330
<b>Those...</b>

01:17.290 --> 01:20.960
<b>I know. I'm going to ask for a lot more
than these tickets can cover.</b>

01:22.580 --> 01:25.210
<b>Let's just say we're cutting you a really great deal.</b>

01:26.960 --> 01:28.540
<b>Hero Club!</b>

01:29.130 --> 01:31.000
<b>We're back!</b>

01:34.250 --> 01:37.960
<b>Shh! Shh!</b>

01:34.630 --> 01:36.210
<b>Yeah! We're counting on you!</b>

01:36.210 --> 01:37.500
<b>All right!</b>

01:53.330 --> 01:55.710
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

01:55.710 --> 01:58.540
<b>I posses a special power</b>

01:58.540 --> 02:00.710
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

02:00.710 --> 02:05.170
<b>All are powerless</b>

02:08.250 --> 02:10.960
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

02:10.960 --> 02:13.710
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

02:13.710 --> 02:15.960
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

02:15.960 --> 02:18.330
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

02:18.420 --> 02:21.130
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

02:21.130 --> 02:23.460
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

02:23.460 --> 02:27.290
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

02:27.580 --> 02:29.880
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

02:30.040 --> 02:32.380
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:32.380 --> 02:34.880
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:37.460
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

02:37.460 --> 02:39.830
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

02:39.830 --> 02:42.630
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:42.630 --> 02:45.130
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:45.130 --> 02:47.540
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:47.540 --> 02:50.000
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

02:50.000 --> 02:52.580
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

02:52.580 --> 02:55.130
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

02:55.130 --> 02:57.750
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:57.920 --> 03:00.250
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

03:00.250 --> 03:02.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

03:08.790 --> 03:11.540
<b>Episode 11</b>

03:08.790 --> 03:11.540
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

03:13.630 --> 03:14.880
<b>What's the job?</b>

03:15.330 --> 03:19.080
<b>We need help in the relay for
the meet at the end of the month.</b>

03:19.250 --> 03:21.670
<b>Roger that! Wait to hear back from Pink.</b>

03:22.500 --> 03:23.250
<b>Shoom!</b>

03:29.790 --> 03:34.380
<b>W-wow... We're counting on you, Hero Club!</b>

03:37.670 --> 03:40.750
<b>What's with this note? Is it some encoded request?</b>

03:40.750 --> 03:43.500
<b>No, Benjamin had it in his mouth.</b>

03:43.500 --> 03:44.750
<b>Really?</b>

03:44.750 --> 03:48.290
<b>That cat came over to my house too.
You let him roam way too much.</b>

03:49.080 --> 03:52.380
<b>We have a pen for him,
but he undoes the lock and gets out.</b>

03:52.630 --> 03:53.880
<b>He's pretty smart.</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:57.460
<b>Well, they do say pets take after their owners.</b>

03:57.830 --> 03:59.000
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

03:59.000 --> 04:00.080
<b>Let me see.</b>

04:01.130 --> 04:06.670
<b>From Kasuga text to Hotsuma text,
no writing is indecipherable for Toga Ryushoin.</b>

04:06.920 --> 04:07.750
<b>Here.</b>

04:10.210 --> 04:11.710
<b>What does it say?</b>

04:14.420 --> 04:18.750
<b>The offering for the phoenix devoid of wings,
that fundamental source necessary for the living.</b>

04:18.750 --> 04:22.580
<b>The parched corpse with its flesh sliced open</b>

04:22.580 --> 04:24.420
<b>is sacrifice for an intoxicating feast,
or the Sleeper of R'lyeh...</b>

04:24.790 --> 04:27.830
<b>Hmm, without an explanation
I have no idea what that means.</b>

04:32.210 --> 04:33.170
<b>I'll get that.</b>

04:34.830 --> 04:36.380
<b>Say the password.</b>

04:36.710 --> 04:37.380
<b>Sora.</b>

04:37.380 --> 04:38.330
<b>My waifu.</b>

04:40.540 --> 04:42.380
<b>Is this really necessary?</b>

04:42.380 --> 04:45.960
<b>We can't have the evil organization find out
about our underground activities.</b>

04:45.960 --> 04:47.710
<b>Let's keep this hardboiled.</b>

04:47.710 --> 04:48.960
<b>Pink!</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:50.330
<b>Noda-kun?</b>

04:50.330 --> 04:53.250
<b>Pink!</b>

04:54.330 --> 04:56.080
<b>We got a request from the Track and Field team!</b>

04:56.080 --> 04:56.830
<b>Wha-?!</b>

04:57.000 --> 04:59.290
<b>Wh-what did you climb up?!</b>

04:59.580 --> 05:01.290
<b>That's a job for Yamato.</b>

05:01.290 --> 05:02.330
<b>No one cares?!</b>

05:02.750 --> 05:03.880
<b>You want in, Green?</b>

05:04.290 --> 05:09.960
<b>Not me. We don't want all the kitties in the stands
to faint watching me run now, do we?</b>

05:09.960 --> 05:10.790
<b>Ugh.</b>

05:10.790 --> 05:13.210
<b>Okay, Noda-kun it is.</b>

05:13.460 --> 05:17.170
<b>Got it! Purple, you'll make us a boxed lunch, right?!</b>

05:17.580 --> 05:18.880
<b>Huh? Why should I?</b>

05:18.880 --> 05:20.790
<b>Because your food tastes great, of course.</b>

05:22.710 --> 05:26.290
<b>If you're that desperate, I might make one for you.</b>

05:26.460 --> 05:27.500
<b>If you're flattered, say so.</b>

05:27.500 --> 05:31.000
<b>Shut up, Futaba! Zip it!
You seriously get on my nerves!</b>

05:31.290 --> 05:33.290
<b>Inter-High School</b>

05:31.290 --> 05:33.290
<b>Sports Tournament</b>

05:31.290 --> 05:33.290
<b>Track and</b>

05:31.290 --> 05:33.290
<b>Field Meet</b>

05:31.500 --> 05:32.880
<b>You've got this!</b>

05:32.880 --> 05:34.130
<b>Go, go!</b>

05:36.670 --> 05:38.500
<b>Good job, Yamato!</b>

05:37.630 --> 05:39.290
<b>Come on, Noda-kun!</b>

05:39.880 --> 05:41.750
<b>All right, Yamato!</b>

05:46.790 --> 05:48.040
<b>So good!</b>

05:48.040 --> 05:50.920
<b>Your food's just the best, Purple!</b>

05:51.080 --> 05:53.750
<b>This is nothing compared to what I could really do!</b>

05:54.500 --> 05:55.960
<b>You know, this is fun.</b>

05:56.210 --> 05:57.880
<b>I'm having fun, too!</b>

05:57.880 --> 05:59.080
<b>You're always having fun, Yamato.</b>

05:59.080 --> 06:00.830
<b>Hey! That's my fried chicken!</b>

06:00.830 --> 06:02.750
<b>No fair, Yellow!</b>

06:02.960 --> 06:05.290
<b>You shouldn't have put your guard down, then.</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:08.920
<b>What's that?</b>

06:08.920 --> 06:10.750
<b>They're here for the fried chicken thief...!</b>

06:10.960 --> 06:12.330
<b>I seriously doubt that!</b>

06:12.750 --> 06:15.580
<b>It's probably because of all
those random things getting stolen.</b>

06:18.880 --> 06:22.830
<b>Who knows what else might happen?
Keep an eye on Faust, okay?</b>

06:23.130 --> 06:26.210
<b>Not a problem. I sealed him in his birdcage today.</b>

06:26.210 --> 06:28.750
<b>Silence imbecile! Silence imbecile!</b>

06:29.080 --> 06:29.960
<b>Wha-?!</b>

06:30.290 --> 06:32.330
<b>He broke through the seal?!</b>

06:34.880 --> 06:39.080
<b>Thanks to Nod- ...we got some good results!</b>

06:39.380 --> 06:43.250
<b>We can't thank the Hero Cl- ...enough!</b>

06:45.130 --> 06:46.000
<b>What's up?</b>

06:46.000 --> 06:48.290
<b>It's just, something smells funny...</b>

06:49.790 --> 06:51.000
<b>You're right.</b>

06:52.130 --> 06:54.210
<b>It smells kinds... fishy?</b>

06:58.710 --> 06:59.830
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:00.630 --> 07:02.210
<b>Do you hear that weird sound?</b>

07:02.210 --> 07:03.960
<b>Isn't it getting closer?</b>

07:06.290 --> 07:07.580
<b>L-look...!</b>

07:21.460 --> 07:22.580
<b>Did you hear?</b>

07:22.580 --> 07:24.920
<b>Some track and field people got attacked, right?</b>

07:24.920 --> 07:27.580
<b>So scary... What's going on?!</b>

07:27.580 --> 07:29.670
<b>Apparently there was blood all over the place.</b>

07:29.670 --> 07:31.500
<b>Huh? I just heard they just got beat up real bad.</b>

07:31.500 --> 07:33.670
<b>Apparently the swim team got hit, too.</b>

07:34.000 --> 07:35.880
<b>Yeah, I heard! Sato, right?</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:40.380
<b>I saw him. He's all white, wrapped in bandages.
He looks like Sukekiyo.</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:40.380
<b>Note: Sukekiyo is a character with a white rubber mask</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:40.380
<b>from a classic murder mystery.</b>

07:40.380 --> 07:41.080
<b>Who?</b>

07:41.080 --> 07:42.670
<b>That's really scary.</b>

07:43.380 --> 07:44.880
<b>Student Council President</b>

07:46.210 --> 07:48.460
<b>First theft, and now physical injury...</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:55.380
<b>Vice President                                            Secretary</b>

07:49.670 --> 07:52.460
<b>Exaggerated rumors are all over town now.</b>

07:53.040 --> 07:55.210
<b>The staff room was in an uproar.</b>

07:55.670 --> 08:00.210
<b>The prospective student visit for the coming year
has been postponed as well.</b>

08:06.040 --> 08:07.880
<b>It's a perilous situation.</b>

08:08.920 --> 08:14.080
<b>Trust</b>

08:09.080 --> 08:14.880
<b>All the trust and accomplishments that the students
have worked so hard to gain will be for nothing.</b>

08:15.790 --> 08:19.920
<b>The End</b>

08:16.170 --> 08:18.040
<b>We have to think of something soon...</b>

08:20.790 --> 08:21.920
<b>Oh!</b>

08:22.830 --> 08:25.380
<b>Were you about to bring up the Hero Club?</b>

08:25.380 --> 08:27.250
<b>They would be right for the job...</b>

08:27.540 --> 08:31.670
<b>We shut them down.
We can't possibly ask them for help now.</b>

08:31.670 --> 08:34.040
<b>You're right. I'm sorry.</b>

08:37.630 --> 08:39.330
<b>Whatever are we going to do?</b>

08:41.630 --> 08:43.960
<b>We've brought you here for one reason.</b>

08:43.960 --> 08:47.210
<b>I know! You want us to take out that monster!</b>

08:47.500 --> 08:50.000
<b>Right, I'm glad you're quick to catch on.</b>

08:50.420 --> 08:54.540
<b>The monster sightings have all been
around this club activities building.</b>

08:54.920 --> 08:56.830
<b>Right, track and field team?</b>

08:56.830 --> 08:59.170
<b>Just thinking about it now makes me nauseous!</b>

08:59.830 --> 09:04.210
<b>From the eyewitness accounts... we drew up this.</b>

09:04.830 --> 09:06.330
<b>The Crawling Chaos...</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:08.710
<b>...Nyarlathotep!</b>

09:08.920 --> 09:09.960
<b>You know this?</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:16.500
<b>Indeed. Eons before the gods created humankind,
I battled these fiends.</b>

09:16.920 --> 09:18.330
<b>Oh yeah, them.</b>

09:18.330 --> 09:20.460
<b>Then you're a fellow warrior of time and space?!</b>

09:20.710 --> 09:25.500
<b>No, he means Nyorko-chan: A Crawling Chaos, right?
That opening song was out of this world.</b>

09:25.880 --> 09:28.710
<b>Totally! I have a Hasu-tan action figure up in my room.</b>

09:27.710 --> 09:30.500
<b>Sorry, I have no idea what you're all talking about...</b>

09:29.170 --> 09:30.500
<b>It is unmentionable.</b>

09:30.500 --> 09:31.790
<b>I don't blame you.</b>

09:33.000 --> 09:36.670
<b>So, getting back on track. Listen to this.</b>

09:40.880 --> 09:44.670
<b>The camera I set up just for kicks recorded this sound.</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:49.330
<b>The work of Cthulhu... or perhaps the Deep Ones...?</b>

09:52.290 --> 09:54.080
<b>We're missing the swim team.</b>

09:54.420 --> 09:57.130
<b>The captain's out of commission
with what happened to Sato.</b>

09:57.670 --> 10:01.630
<b>This affects all of us!
If this problem continues... what?!</b>

10:01.960 --> 10:03.630
<b>It'll kill team spirit!</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:05.460
<b>People will quit the club!</b>

10:05.460 --> 10:06.920
<b>The club will be shut down!</b>

10:06.920 --> 10:10.380
<b>A triple combo of misery!</b>

10:11.880 --> 10:16.040
<b>This problem affects the future of Minakami High!</b>

10:16.670 --> 10:18.420
<b>It's our job to protect the future!</b>

10:19.080 --> 10:21.040
<b>I guess we'll go search the site.</b>

10:21.040 --> 10:21.540
<b>Huh...?</b>

10:21.540 --> 10:22.330
<b>Sounds good.</b>

10:22.330 --> 10:23.170
<b>Uh?!</b>

10:23.380 --> 10:25.080
<b>T-Takashima, what about you?</b>

10:26.290 --> 10:27.130
<b>Come on baby...</b>

10:27.130 --> 10:27.670
<b>What?</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:29.830
<b>I'll hold you in a clever embrace!</b>

10:35.670 --> 10:37.710
<b>Got you, Sora-chan!</b>

10:37.710 --> 10:42.420
<b>A 0.001% chance, super ultra rare, SSR card!!</b>

10:43.000 --> 10:46.420
<b>I feel like I could save the world right now!</b>

10:47.290 --> 10:48.710
<b>You're coming too, right, Tsukumo-kun?</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:50.710
<b>Yup...</b>

10:50.290 --> 10:51.830
<b>Actually scared</b>

10:50.710 --> 10:51.830
<b>It's decided then!</b>

10:52.630 --> 10:57.790
<b>If anything happens, fire this. It's a starter pistol for races.</b>

10:58.330 --> 11:03.380
<b>The mage's gun to summon immaculate white
phosphorescence from far beyond the darkness spiral...</b>

11:04.880 --> 11:06.000
<b>We'll take it.</b>

11:19.500 --> 11:21.630
<b>You're up to something again.</b>

11:21.630 --> 11:23.790
<b>Don't try to stop us.</b>

11:24.420 --> 11:28.830
<b>We're doing this for the people
who believe in us and need our help!</b>

11:29.500 --> 11:34.250
<b>Uh-huh. That means anyone,
including you lot in the Student Council.</b>

11:34.500 --> 11:37.380
<b>That's what a hero... A messiah, does.</b>

11:39.130 --> 11:40.750
<b>Messiah</b>

11:40.920 --> 11:44.380
<b>Listen closely. If worst comes to worst, Eterna-</b>

11:44.710 --> 11:47.500
<b>That was close. I mustn't speak of that here.</b>

11:47.500 --> 11:51.500
<b>"Eter"... Uh? What was that again? Um...</b>

11:51.500 --> 11:53.000
<b>I knew you'd forget.</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:53.670
<b>Oh, yeah...</b>

11:53.670 --> 11:55.080
<b>What do you...</b>

11:57.540 --> 11:58.630
<b>What...</b>

12:00.630 --> 12:03.080
<b>...could you possibly intend on doing?!</b>

12:05.040 --> 12:07.000
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:08.630 --> 12:10.540
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:13.290 --> 12:17.000
<b>You can hold on to my hand if you're scared, you know?</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:20.960
<b>I'm fine. Somehow, I'm not scared
when I'm with everyone here.</b>

12:21.330 --> 12:22.290
<b>Huh?</b>

12:23.330 --> 12:25.210
<b>Ohmigewdness!</b>

12:25.210 --> 12:26.380
<b>Shh!</b>

12:26.380 --> 12:27.500
<b>Wh-what?!</b>

12:27.790 --> 12:29.960
<b>Oh sorry. There was a mosquito.</b>

12:29.960 --> 12:31.630
<b>It's almost winter!</b>

12:31.790 --> 12:36.170
<b>Apparently mosquitoes can now survive
the winter due to global warming.</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:40.670
<b>Global warming, huh? Noda-kun said
something like that before, too.</b>

12:41.000 --> 12:41.880
<b>Shh!</b>

12:49.920 --> 12:50.960
<b>Over there?!</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:56.670
<b>No, it's an iguana!</b>

12:56.670 --> 12:58.630
<b>You escaped again?!</b>

12:59.630 --> 13:01.920
<b>So this was the "monster"?</b>

13:07.790 --> 13:08.710
<b>Watch out!</b>

13:08.710 --> 13:09.880
<b>Don't let it target your eyes!</b>

13:11.500 --> 13:13.080
<b>Silence imbecile.</b>

13:13.500 --> 13:15.670
<b>Faust! Why are you here?!</b>

13:17.420 --> 13:18.420
<b>Where is it?!</b>

13:18.420 --> 13:19.500
<b>Show yourself!</b>

13:19.710 --> 13:20.750
<b>I don't know!</b>

13:26.500 --> 13:27.630
<b>Benjamin?!</b>

13:27.960 --> 13:29.250
<b>Why are you here?</b>

13:29.420 --> 13:32.250
<b>An iguana, a parakeet, and now a cat?</b>

13:32.630 --> 13:34.540
<b>What kind of petting zoo is this?</b>

13:36.710 --> 13:37.960
<b>What now?!</b>

13:38.420 --> 13:46.040
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

13:48.380 --> 13:49.420
<b>It's huge!</b>

13:58.040 --> 13:59.330
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

13:59.880 --> 14:00.920
<b>A penguin?!</b>

14:01.170 --> 14:04.080
<b>Ah, so that's what that note meant.</b>

14:04.420 --> 14:05.540
<b>What do you mean?</b>

14:05.540 --> 14:07.420
<b>It's because of global warming!</b>

14:08.210 --> 14:12.210
<b>Angry Antarctic penguins have united to invade Japan!</b>

14:13.460 --> 14:14.790
<b>Keep that stuff for your dreams!</b>

14:15.580 --> 14:16.790
<b>I shall seal it!</b>

14:16.790 --> 14:20.210
<b>Wait! We mustn't let such a tragic war begin!</b>

14:21.210 --> 14:23.460
<b>Feel the wrath of my power!</b>

14:24.830 --> 14:26.330
<b>The time has come!</b>

14:26.790 --> 14:28.670
<b>Taste the bitterness of defeat!</b>

14:32.210 --> 14:35.000
<b>FAUST!!</b>

14:35.290 --> 14:37.580
<b>Urkkill... Urkkillme...</b>

14:37.710 --> 14:41.750
<b>Whoa-whoa-whoa! Calm down!
We can talk this through! Calm down!</b>

14:46.710 --> 14:47.880
<b>The penguin's getting away!</b>

14:50.000 --> 14:51.250
<b>Oh no, you don't!</b>

14:54.380 --> 14:55.790
<b>Trap it from both sides!</b>

14:57.710 --> 14:59.630
<b>That's cold! They can't be serious!</b>

14:59.630 --> 15:00.630
<b>Hijiri-san!</b>

15:00.630 --> 15:02.000
<b>Huh? Uh, yeah?</b>

15:02.000 --> 15:03.250
<b>Look after Benjamin for me!</b>

15:06.080 --> 15:07.210
<b>They're heavy...</b>

15:13.540 --> 15:15.000
<b>It's too dark to see!</b>

15:15.000 --> 15:16.790
<b>I shall unleash it now!</b>

15:17.040 --> 15:18.040
<b>Let there be light!</b>

15:21.420 --> 15:25.670
<b>I demand a sacrifice!
Defeat the wingless aquatic creature!</b>

15:26.330 --> 15:27.880
<b>We've got your back!</b>

15:32.210 --> 15:33.960
<b>Easy for you to say.</b>

15:33.960 --> 15:35.750
<b>Underwater Hurricane!</b>

15:37.210 --> 15:38.710
<b>Whirrrr!</b>

15:39.630 --> 15:41.290
<b>Nakamura! Come join us!</b>

15:42.710 --> 15:45.170
<b>That I cannot do. A long time ago, I-</b>

15:50.380 --> 15:53.750
<b>I tasted a forbidden fruit when</b>

15:50.380 --> 15:53.750
<b>I got stranded on a deserted island,</b>

15:54.130 --> 15:56.170
<b>and gained new powers in exchange for</b>

15:56.460 --> 15:58.790
<b>losing the ability to ever swim again.</b>

16:01.290 --> 16:02.460
<b>Oh no!</b>

16:03.540 --> 16:05.040
<b>Nakamura-kun's drowning!</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:05.960
<b>Got it!</b>

16:09.830 --> 16:10.830
<b>Nakamura-kun!</b>

16:10.830 --> 16:11.830
<b>Black!</b>

16:12.040 --> 16:13.040
<b>Are you okay?!</b>

16:13.250 --> 16:17.880
<b>This is it for me... See you... in my next life...</b>

16:20.130 --> 16:21.670
<b>Stay with us!</b>

16:24.830 --> 16:26.080
<b>Yamato Noda.</b>

16:27.210 --> 16:30.130
<b>"Eternal Force Blizzard."</b>

16:31.670 --> 16:33.080
<b>Did you hear that, Pink?!</b>

16:33.080 --> 16:34.540
<b>Huh? Yeah...</b>

16:34.880 --> 16:36.460
<b>But that's...!</b>

16:36.830 --> 16:43.130
<b>You're the only one that I, Toga Ryushoin,
deem worthy of using it in this life.</b>

16:44.250 --> 16:46.580
<b>Damn, it keeps getting away!</b>

16:46.880 --> 16:49.750
<b>The water is that thing's territory.</b>

16:49.750 --> 16:51.130
<b>What do we do, Yamato?!</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:54.080
<b>Get it...</b>

16:54.380 --> 16:56.040
<b>out of the pool!</b>

16:56.380 --> 16:58.080
<b>You have a plan, huh?</b>

16:58.580 --> 16:59.500
<b>Yup!</b>

16:59.830 --> 17:00.710
<b>Stupid!</b>

17:06.670 --> 17:07.960
<b>Hero Club!</b>

17:09.000 --> 17:11.000
<b>Go, Hero Club!</b>

17:09.000 --> 17:10.210
<b>Go get it!</b>

17:11.330 --> 17:13.000
<b>You've got this!</b>

17:11.580 --> 17:13.380
<b>We believe in you!</b>

17:17.210 --> 17:20.250
<b>Mizuki-chan! You've got this!</b>

17:20.750 --> 17:22.710
<b>Nanako-chan... All of you...!</b>

17:25.130 --> 17:25.880
<b>It's out!</b>

17:26.080 --> 17:30.290
<b>We'll seal it with the ultimate spell Black left for us!</b>

17:31.170 --> 17:33.880
<b>O seraphim of highest angelic rank...</b>

17:34.210 --> 17:36.790
<b>O dark overlord Lucifer, ruler of chaos...</b>

17:37.460 --> 17:43.880
<b>Let your opposing infinite energies combine
to deliver the final judgment in this moment.</b>

17:40.580 --> 17:43.000
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

17:43.000 --> 17:45.830
<b>I posses a special power</b>

17:44.710 --> 17:49.380
<b>Let freezing ice and a blossoming
blizzard engulf all before us.</b>

17:45.830 --> 17:48.000
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

17:48.000 --> 17:52.460
<b>All are powerless</b>

17:55.540 --> 17:58.250
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

17:58.250 --> 18:01.040
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

18:00.330 --> 18:01.420
<b>You know...</b>

18:01.040 --> 18:03.250
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

18:02.960 --> 18:05.880
<b>...being with everyone changed me!</b>

18:03.250 --> 18:05.630
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:08.420
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

18:08.250 --> 18:11.830
<b>I always thought it was all a delusion, but now...!</b>

18:08.420 --> 18:10.750
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

18:10.750 --> 18:14.540
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

18:12.790 --> 18:13.710
<b>Red!</b>

18:14.830 --> 18:17.130
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

18:16.460 --> 18:17.380
<b>Pink!</b>

18:17.290 --> 18:19.630
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

18:18.000 --> 18:21.670
<b>The time has come for me to unleash my true power!</b>

18:19.630 --> 18:22.130
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

18:22.040 --> 18:23.540
<b>You've awakened?!</b>

18:22.130 --> 18:24.750
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

18:24.670 --> 18:25.960
<b>Trust me!</b>

18:24.750 --> 18:27.130
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

18:27.130 --> 18:29.920
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

18:28.830 --> 18:31.000
<b>I've trusted you from the moment we met!</b>

18:29.920 --> 18:32.420
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

18:32.420 --> 18:34.830
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

18:32.670 --> 18:33.500
<b>Let's do this!</b>

18:33.500 --> 18:34.500
<b>Yeah!</b>

18:34.830 --> 18:37.290
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

18:35.130 --> 18:39.210
<b>Answer my call in accordance with our ancient pact.</b>

18:37.290 --> 18:39.880
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

18:39.540 --> 18:40.460
<b>The ultimate technique!</b>

18:39.880 --> 18:42.420
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

18:40.670 --> 18:41.710
<b>Eternal...</b>

18:41.830 --> 18:42.960
<b>Force...</b>

18:42.420 --> 18:45.040
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

18:43.250 --> 18:49.290
<b>Blizzard!</b>

18:45.210 --> 18:47.540
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

18:47.540 --> 18:50.130
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

19:07.380 --> 19:08.460
<b>Stop it!</b>

19:10.710 --> 19:12.830
<b>Did you just hear a voice?</b>

19:13.830 --> 19:14.500
<b>Huh?!</b>

19:14.500 --> 19:15.830
<b>Sukekiyo?!</b>

19:21.960 --> 19:24.580
<b>Hey! It's Contestant Sato from
the "Fight it out! 100-meter dash"!</b>

19:24.920 --> 19:25.750
<b>Who?</b>

19:26.130 --> 19:28.420
<b>He's Sato from the swim team
who said he wasn't confident,</b>

19:28.420 --> 19:32.080
<b>then overtook me to take third place on Sports Day!</b>

19:33.330 --> 19:34.790
<b>Oh yeah, him!</b>

19:38.330 --> 19:40.420
<b>Were you keeping the penguin at school?</b>

19:40.960 --> 19:46.250
<b>Penguins push fish and octopi into their throats using
the spines on their tongue and upper beak!</b>

19:46.380 --> 19:47.920
<b>I'm sure of it now.</b>

19:48.460 --> 19:50.630
<b>This note belongs to you.</b>

19:50.960 --> 19:51.920
<b>Oh, hey!</b>

19:52.210 --> 19:56.420
<b>The offering for the phoenix devoid of wings,
that fundamental source necessary for the living.</b>

19:56.750 --> 20:03.330
<b>The parched corpse with its flesh sliced open is
sacrifice for an intoxicating feast, or the Sleeper of R'lyeh!</b>

20:03.710 --> 20:05.920
<b>Food for a penguin: horse mackerel, octopi, etc.</b>

20:06.170 --> 20:09.170
<b>Yes! So I did drop that somewhere.</b>

20:09.830 --> 20:13.790
<b>Uh-huh? So you stole the horse mackerel
from home economics.</b>

20:14.040 --> 20:15.670
<b>And the octopus from biology.</b>

20:15.670 --> 20:16.420
<b>Urg...!</b>

20:16.920 --> 20:19.710
<b>The branches from the athletic field and
the timber from the Drama Club, too?</b>

20:20.170 --> 20:23.000
<b>You wanted to make a nest for the penguin, huh?</b>

20:23.420 --> 20:28.540
<b>I went to get something I forgot after practice,
and found him swimming in the pool.</b>

20:29.170 --> 20:32.130
<b>I just wanted to let him swim here a bit longer...</b>

20:37.580 --> 20:40.000
<b>Call an ambulance!</b>

20:42.960 --> 20:47.830
<b>In regards to the case of
the escaped animal from the zoo,</b>

20:47.830 --> 20:51.880
<b>you helped secure the penguin and
contributed to the safety of the community.</b>

20:51.880 --> 20:54.330
<b>We hereby express our gratitude for your efforts.</b>

20:57.670 --> 20:59.710
<b>Did you hear about yesterday's tornado?</b>

20:59.710 --> 21:02.210
<b>Yeah, I did! It was right on our school's pool!</b>

21:02.210 --> 21:05.170
<b>Apparently there was a storm warning in the area.</b>

21:05.170 --> 21:07.250
<b>They say it was some freak weather thing.</b>

21:08.880 --> 21:12.000
<b>What if that Hero Club actually had some weird powers?</b>

21:14.210 --> 21:15.580
<b>Please accept this.</b>

21:17.670 --> 21:18.460
<b>Hm?</b>

21:18.830 --> 21:20.380
<b>We don't need a certificate!</b>

21:21.460 --> 21:23.460
<b>Just give us back our place!</b>

21:23.830 --> 21:24.630
<b>"Place"?</b>

21:25.130 --> 21:25.920
<b>Our clubroom!</b>

21:25.920 --> 21:27.670
<b>We need that place!</b>

21:28.080 --> 21:32.250
<b>A sanctuary of respite for warriors
gathered together by fate.</b>

21:32.670 --> 21:36.170
<b>A place where we can really be ourselves.</b>

21:36.580 --> 21:40.290
<b>I mean, everyone needs a place like that, right?</b>

21:40.290 --> 21:43.330
<b>Yeah! Give them back their clubroom!</b>

21:43.790 --> 21:45.670
<b>Bring the Hero Club back!</b>

21:45.670 --> 21:47.040
<b>Hear, hear!</b>

21:47.540 --> 21:48.630
<b>You guys...</b>

21:49.830 --> 21:50.880
<b>I see.</b>

21:53.540 --> 21:56.630
<b>Your efforts deserve to be honored.</b>

21:57.080 --> 22:00.710
<b>We can't let you go without
awarding you with something...</b>

22:01.630 --> 22:02.500
<b>I suppose.</b>

22:02.500 --> 22:04.040
<b>The key to the clubroom?!</b>

22:05.170 --> 22:06.130
<b>Thanks!</b>

22:06.130 --> 22:07.750
<b>You're very welcome.</b>

22:09.080 --> 22:13.880
<b>The Student Council hereby acknowledges
the Hero Club as a legitimate club!</b>

22:15.920 --> 22:18.170
<b>Yes!</b>

22:19.000 --> 22:23.670
<b>A vivid melody shrouded in a seasonal wind</b>

22:23.670 --> 22:26.750
<b>Calls to me</b>

22:26.040 --> 22:29.040
<b>Hero Club</b>

22:26.040 --> 22:29.040
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

22:26.750 --> 22:28.880
<b>This just feels so right!</b>

22:27.000 --> 22:34.250
<b>Rhythm overflows, accelerating the sound of footsteps</b>

22:29.250 --> 22:30.290
<b>It does.</b>

22:30.460 --> 22:32.460
<b>Nice calligraphy, Ryushoin.</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:36.460
<b>From hieroglyphics to Phoenician,
no writing is beyond my expertise.</b>

22:34.670 --> 22:42.500
<b>Let's go look for something we'll never get with our heads hanging down</b>

22:36.790 --> 22:39.630
<b>And so our lovably idiotic days begin.</b>

22:39.960 --> 22:42.710
<b>It's our fate to live in the moment, I guess?</b>

22:42.710 --> 22:52.710
<b>If I go with you, I'm sure we can leap over the highest of walls</b>

22:42.920 --> 22:45.210
<b>Pink, what's our next job?</b>

22:45.210 --> 22:47.500
<b>Hold on a sec, I'll get my notes out.</b>

22:47.500 --> 22:49.790
<b>Hurry up and tell us!</b>

22:50.420 --> 22:54.330
<b>The Hero Club's first job as a real club!</b>

22:53.130 --> 22:55.420
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:54.460 --> 22:55.710
<b>A stone filled with memories,</b>

22:54.460 --> 22:55.710
<b>lost on the riverbank.</b>

22:55.750 --> 22:59.670
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:55.960 --> 22:56.920
<b>What's this?</b>

22:56.920 --> 22:59.880
<b>"A stone filled with memories, lost on the riverbank"?</b>

22:59.670 --> 23:02.880
<b>On those wings you illustrated</b>

23:00.130 --> 23:05.080
<b>I see. Hide a tree in a forest,
hide a stone on the riverbank.</b>

23:02.880 --> 23:06.670
<b>Keep flying, and to a story</b>

23:05.080 --> 23:07.330
<b>They didn't hide it, they lost it!</b>

23:06.920 --> 23:11.540
<b>We'll soar through tomorrow</b>

23:08.210 --> 23:09.380
<b>How do we look for this?</b>

23:09.830 --> 23:11.920
<b>Hmph, you don't need me for this...</b>

23:11.540 --> 23:15.710
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:14.960 --> 23:17.460
<b>Hey, stop that! Lemme go! Hey!</b>

23:15.710 --> 23:19.040
<b>That heartbeat that won't disappear</b>

23:17.460 --> 23:19.290
<b>You're coming too, obviously.</b>

23:18.290 --> 23:20.790
<b>Wait, you're strong. I can't shake you off!</b>

23:19.040 --> 23:22.960
<b>Keep trying, and to a story</b>

23:19.670 --> 23:20.790
<b>We're counting on you, Yamato!</b>

23:20.790 --> 23:21.790
<b>Sure!</b>

23:22.960 --> 23:26.630
<b>Harmonies overlap</b>

23:26.790 --> 23:32.380
<b>The image of the future that doesn't belong to anyone</b>

23:27.830 --> 23:36.250
<b>Go Forth... and Illuminate... Searchlight!</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:37.750
<b>I'll draw it, with you</b>
